Field(0) on an int               panic: reflect: call of reflect.Value.Field on int Value
Field(2) on a 2-field struct     panic: reflect: Field index out of range
Int() on a string                panic: reflect: call of reflect.Value.Int on string Value
NumField() on an int Type        panic: reflect: NumField of non-struct type int
Elem() on an int                 panic: reflect: call of reflect.Value.Elem on int Value
Elem() on an int Type            panic: reflect: Elem of invalid type int
Call() on an int                 panic: reflect: call of reflect.Value.Call on int Value
Type() on the zero Value         panic: reflect: call of reflect.Value.Type on zero Value
Kind() on the zero Value         no panic: Kind is invalid
TypeOf(nil) is nil, so .Kind()   panic: runtime error: invalid memory address or nil pointer dereference
